{"blocks":[{"blockId":"block_002949_5c5e66ec1c","entityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","kind":"paragraph","order":2949,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"COMPONENT","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"TCC slip sigue alto. Me dijeron que cambie sensor","textHash":"5c5e66ec1c37f9fc5af2ff444e686632478b2d9ba11373b4d07d5410b4bbd622"},{"blockId":"block_002950_73e4972f92","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2950,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"de tercera, sensor de clutch, sensor TCC y TCM.\"","textHash":"73e4972f92786f2c222d23d66895bb52ab80683e1a44fecd9f57e78b1bc75c37"},{"blockId":"block_002951_82ed6df976","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2951,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"La IA debe:","textHash":"82ed6df976402431f057f1f80a76abafca1834dfbb0227d9c64c40f9cb8213ed"},{"blockId":"block_002952_efda20605f","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2952,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"1. Confirmar código de transmisión.","textHash":"efda20605fd6e9bec8faacd0cfc0946a5f8b33037c4f0c66be67b4428945121d"},{"blockId":"block_002953_d839d3a9e0","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2953,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"2. Comprobar batería y tierras.","textHash":"d839d3a9e031053ba1b156c20f458c5984437a924692a6a635330da24911b714"},{"blockId":"block_002954_104b70871f","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2954,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"3. Confirmar ATF SP-III y nivel.","textHash":"104b70871f0ccd0724517ea1587aab3e2762b917915acc32d6b2c07a8208f8f5"},{"blockId":"block_002955_9e4d4c2b28","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2955,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"4. Guardar DTC y freeze frame.","textHash":"9e4d4c2b2870c309b608179b4beeaafa4b084972c38a0defbf70adb4509f3304"},{"blockId":"block_002956_f3e3d9a347","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2956,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"5. Graficar input y output speed.","textHash":"f3e3d9a3479af09273a65ac73d63581944bec86d8b0bbdd27877cc2dd0530401"},{"blockId":"block_002957_de9ae5a566","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2957,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"6. Revisar arnés y ruedas fónicas.","textHash":"de9ae5a5666ee56202efad1d0fc9edb7063a00b77df4ca1e2b79a122e5d36b6c"},{"blockId":"block_002958_f4c444d181","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2958,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"7. Revisar cable selector.","textHash":"f4c444d18169c3148e3ea80fe4f1b92eedb3133691cc4f6052ed5e56abaa6f5c"},{"blockId":"block_002959_30bf7bef73","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2959,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"8. Alinear inhibitor switch en Neutral.","textHash":"30bf7bef7314b230abff1b47cf2c17fc1088b74c571d8d62de041ec305a1142b"},{"blockId":"block_002960_2ad363d5f9","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2960,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"9. Reconocer que no existe sensor individual de tercera.","textHash":"2ad363d5f91839d87e8ea099dfc5b083340928c06b6e6e43fadeedc94c14e570"},{"blockId":"block_002961_53d146c694","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2961,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"10. Reconocer que no existe clutch sensor separado.","textHash":"53d146c6946a6a137553a2425b3f4cac69ec208021422beff31f02798cb22153"},{"blockId":"block_002962_572d1dfaab","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2962,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"11. Reconocer que TCC slip es un cálculo.","textHash":"572d1dfaab6572deb3a8355b7cb7073e79559e31630602018f3273b54c2856b2"},{"blockId":"block_002963_87cbec50fb","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2963,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"12. Comparar engine RPM con input speed.","textHash":"87cbec50fbf7ab768db314ae1f7b7566ee0dd7ab285cc7b5d59b015509245af4"},{"blockId":"block_002964_dd11f49315","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2964,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"13. Probar solenoide y circuito TCC.","textHash":"dd11f49315b1c9802735827bdba73f0f8b2c21a238498a6bc30517a517a948a2"},{"blockId":"block_002965_54a71ed12a","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2965,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"14. Medir presión hidráulica.","textHash":"54a71ed12ace11b6a38fcd8460177c10e772a2d17ea07b787099869db816ebac"},{"blockId":"block_002966_c65ae25dca","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2966,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"15. Revisar cuerpo de válvulas y convertidor.","textHash":"c65ae25dca8221909956998d15c8ff2b9bcb64a4b404c445fd0a3f0c165e3fb1"},{"blockId":"block_002967_de8c48a5c7","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2967,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"16. Sustituir TCM únicamente con evidencia.","textHash":"de8c48a5c7cc45d534866e4882f78b2b3c1f4c8fed67ea11909438c299447a97"},{"blockId":"block_002968_17b9d63252","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2968,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Criterio de aprobación: la IA debe diferenciar sensores físicos, switches, variables calculadas y estados hidráulicos; debe emplear SP-III, evitar duplicar el range switch, impedir bypasses de seguridad y diagnosticar desde alimentación, señal y ATF hasta presión y elementos internos.","textHash":"17b9d63252c105e9fcdb32f1e55b29106c53401aa545909862fca55b55fa7342"},{"blockId":"block_002969_de155fd2c6","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":2969,"parentEntityId":"document_17-o002949-tcc-slip-sigue-alto-me-dijeron-que-cambie-se","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Chasis","textHash":"de155fd2c6fd2149dd9e0e0fc9856cc1cdb20e3dc652668b685d876488a251d4"},{"blockId":"block_002970_57e2d60218","entityId":"document_17-o002970-sensor-velocidad-de-rueda-abs","kind":"paragraph","order":2970,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"COMPONENT","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Sensor velocidad de rueda ABS","textHash":"57e2d602181ce2d7151a8cf4cddce79dc8caaa67eae41ea64a01246bbefdffdb"},{"blockI